# Fragment Animations

This presentation demonstrates **fragment animations** for incremental reveals.

===

# Basic Fragments

::: {.fragment}
This text will fade in
:::

::: {.fragment}
This text will also fade in (on next step)
:::

::: {.fragment}
And this one too!
:::

===

# Fragment Styles

::: {.fragment .fade-out}
This will fade out
:::

::: {.fragment .fade-up}
This will slide up while fading in
:::

::: {.fragment .highlight-red}
This will turn red
:::

::: {.fragment .grow}
This will grow
:::

===

# More Fragment Effects

::: {.fragment .fade-in-then-out}
Fade in, then out
:::

::: {.fragment .fade-in-then-semi-out}
Fade in, then semi out
:::

::: {.fragment .shrink}
This will shrink
:::

::: {.fragment .strike}
This will be struck through
:::

===

# Highlight Effects

::: {.fragment .highlight-blue}
Highlight blue
:::

::: {.fragment .highlight-green}
Highlight green
:::

::: {.fragment .highlight-current-red}
Highlight red, then back
:::

::: {.fragment .semi-fade-out}
Semi fade out (50%)
:::

===

# Nested Fragments

::: {.fragment .fade-in}
::: {.fragment .highlight-red}
::: {.fragment .semi-fade-out}
Fade in > Turn red > Semi fade out
:::
:::
:::

===

# Custom Order

::: {.fragment fragment-index=3}
Appears last (index 3)
:::

::: {.fragment fragment-index=1}
Appears first (index 1)
:::

::: {.fragment fragment-index=2}
Appears second (index 2)
:::

===

# Fragment Lists

Unordered list with fragments:

::: {.fragment}
- First item
- Second item
:::

::: {.fragment}
- Third item
- Fourth item
:::

===

# Mixed Content

::: {.fragment}
## This header appears first
:::

::: {.fragment .highlight-blue}
This paragraph appears second and turns blue
:::

::: {.fragment .fade-up}
![Demo Image](https://placehold.co/400x300)
:::

===

# Code with Fragments

::: {.fragment}
```javascript
function hello() {
    console.log("This code appears first");
}
```
:::

::: {.fragment .highlight-green}
The code will appear, then this text turns green!
:::

